{
    "title": "Zombie Waves",
    "description": "Embark on a doomsday survival saga in the dystopian wasteland of \"Zombie Waves,\" where waves of relentless undead zombies are a constant threat. In this 3D roguelike shooting game, navigate through a post-apocalyptic nightmare, survive against impossible odds, and master the art of zombie shooting. Upgrade your guns and learn survivor skills to confront the never-ending tide of zombies in this ultimate zombies game. Decipher the outbreak's mysteries and stand as the last beacon of hope for humanity in a world ravaged by the zombie invasion.\r\n\r\n<b>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</b>\r\n\r\n<b>EASY-PLAY EXPERIENCE</b>\r\n<b>\u00b7Effortless One-Handed Controls:</b> Enjoy smooth combat with simple one-handed controls. Ideal for stress-free, yet captivating play.\r\n<b>\u00b7Auto-Aim Precision: </b>Experience streamlined gameplay with an auto-aim feature, ensuring every shot counts.\r\n<b>\u00b7Quick Play Sessions: </b>Perfect for breaks, with game rounds lasting 6-12 minutes.\r\n<b>\u00b7Idle Gameplay: </b>Earn rewards even when you're offline with the AFK mechanics.\r\n\r\n<b>RPG PROGRESSION SYSTEM</b>\r\n<b>\u00b7Strategic Hero Play: </b>Select from an array of unique heroes, each boasting distinct abilities. Combine weapons and skills to carve your path to dominance.\r\n<b>\u00b7Robot Companions: </b>Enhance your combat capabilities with customizable robot sidekicks.\r\n<b>\u00b7Diverse Equipment: </b>Amass a variety of gear to bolster your arsenal and overcome new challenges.\r\n\r\n<b>INTENSE COMBAT EXPERIENCE</b>\r\n<b>\u00b7Roguelike Skill Synergy: </b>Over 100 roguelike skills and powerful ultimate abilities offer a unique combat dance every time.\r\n<b>\u00b7Immersive Battlefields: </b>Engage in heart-pounding survival across varied stages. Use the terrain to your advantage and gain the upper hand.\r\n<b>\u00b7Spectacular Combat Effects: </b>Enjoy the exhilarating sensation of full-screen eliminations with stunning visual effects.\r\n<b>\u00b7Mowing Down Hordes: </b>Face overwhelming waves of monsters in exhilarating, large-scale battles.\r\n\r\n<b>DIVERSE GAME MODES</b>\r\n<b>\u00b7Formidable Boss Foes: </b>Confront a variety of grotesque bosses, each presenting a unique tactical challenge.\r\n<b>\u00b7Competitive & Co-op Modes: </b>Dive into both competitive battles and cooperative play, adding more strategy and fun.\r\n<b>\u00b7Intriguing Sub-Game Modes: </b>Explore various play styles, including roguelike tower climbs, survival modes, vehicle racing, and more.\r\n<b>\u00b7Camp Building: </b>Build and customize your home base, adding more depth to your survival adventure.\r\n\r\nAre you ready to face the endless zombie hordes in \"Zombie Waves\"? Gear up, strategize, and fight for victory in humanity\u2019s darkest hour!\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>SUPPORT</b>\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/ZombieWavesGame\r\nFacebook fan group: https://www.facebook.com/groups/zombiewaves\r\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/zombiewaves\r\nCustomer Service: service.zombiewaves@gmail.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Embark on a doomsday survival saga in the dystopian wasteland of &quot;Zombie Waves,&quot; where waves of relentless undead zombies are a constant threat. In this 3D roguelike shooting game, navigate through a post-apocalyptic nightmare, survive against impossible odds, and master the art of zombie shooting. Upgrade your guns and learn survivor skills to confront the never-ending tide of zombies in this ultimate zombies game. Decipher the outbreak&#39;s mysteries and stand as the last beacon of hope for humanity in a world ravaged by the zombie invasion.<br><br><b>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</b><br><br><b>EASY-PLAY EXPERIENCE</b><br><b>\u00b7Effortless One-Handed Controls:</b> Enjoy smooth combat with simple one-handed controls. Ideal for stress-free, yet captivating play.<br><b>\u00b7Auto-Aim Precision: </b>Experience streamlined gameplay with an auto-aim feature, ensuring every shot counts.<br><b>\u00b7Quick Play Sessions: </b>Perfect for breaks, with game rounds lasting 6-12 minutes.<br><b>\u00b7Idle Gameplay: </b>Earn rewards even when you&#39;re offline with the AFK mechanics.<br><br><b>RPG PROGRESSION SYSTEM</b><br><b>\u00b7Strategic Hero Play: </b>Select from an array of unique heroes, each boasting distinct abilities. Combine weapons and skills to carve your path to dominance.<br><b>\u00b7Robot Companions: </b>Enhance your combat capabilities with customizable robot sidekicks.<br><b>\u00b7Diverse Equipment: </b>Amass a variety of gear to bolster your arsenal and overcome new challenges.<br><br><b>INTENSE COMBAT EXPERIENCE</b><br><b>\u00b7Roguelike Skill Synergy: </b>Over 100 roguelike skills and powerful ultimate abilities offer a unique combat dance every time.<br><b>\u00b7Immersive Battlefields: </b>Engage in heart-pounding survival across varied stages. Use the terrain to your advantage and gain the upper hand.<br><b>\u00b7Spectacular Combat Effects: </b>Enjoy the exhilarating sensation of full-screen eliminations with stunning visual effects.<br><b>\u00b7Mowing Down Hordes: </b>Face overwhelming waves of monsters in exhilarating, large-scale battles.<br><br><b>DIVERSE GAME MODES</b><br><b>\u00b7Formidable Boss Foes: </b>Confront a variety of grotesque bosses, each presenting a unique tactical challenge.<br><b>\u00b7Competitive &amp; Co-op Modes: </b>Dive into both competitive battles and cooperative play, adding more strategy and fun.<br><b>\u00b7Intriguing Sub-Game Modes: </b>Explore various play styles, including roguelike tower climbs, survival modes, vehicle racing, and more.<br><b>\u00b7Camp Building: </b>Build and customize your home base, adding more depth to your survival adventure.<br><br>Are you ready to face the endless zombie hordes in &quot;Zombie Waves&quot;? Gear up, strategize, and fight for victory in humanity\u2019s darkest hour!<br><br><br><b>SUPPORT</b><br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/ZombieWavesGame<br>Facebook fan group: https://www.facebook.com/groups/zombiewaves<br>Discord: https://discord.gg/zombiewaves<br>Customer Service: service.zombiewaves@gmail.com",
